Package: kleaflet.r
Title: Concise, Composable Interactive Maps from a Single Call
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = c("Kevin", "Bosirany"),
      family = "Orlando",
      email = "kevinbosirany@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-2784-3108")
    )
  )
Description: Draw a complete interactive 'leaflet' map (coordinates,
    colour palettes, legends, popups, labels, groups, base map, view) with a
    single short call, and compose maps with the '+' operator through the
    'kleaflet' S3 class. Layer types, themes and palettes live in extensible
    registries.
